          "description": "Step into the whispering woods, stormy seas, and fall festivals with Tales from Willow Grove — a collection of original, atmospheric audio stories for curious young listeners. \nNote: These stories have just the right amount of spooky with mysterious twists, turns, and a touch of goosebumps! While there are no graphic or gory details, some tales include tense moments (like being followed, mysterious figures, or ghosts) that might be intense for sensitive listeners. Recommended for ages 7-12.",
